  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expenditure Verification of contract CSO-LA/2017/394-823: Plan International DE - Civil Society as active drivers of change for inclusive quality education in Kassala Stage - Folowing AAP 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Expenditure Verification of contract CSO-LA/2017/394-823: Plan International DE - Civil Society as active drivers of change for inclusive quality education in Kassala Stage - Folowing AAP 2022 - This action will support the Bolivian system in the fight against GBV, reducing impunity and enhancing attention services. Through a transformative and comprehensive approach, it will strengthen the institutional structure and extend access to essential integrated services and preventive measures. Implemented at national and regional levels, it targets 20 rural municipalities from the valley, eastern, and high plateau regions. Women&apos;s access to essential services there is limited or non-existent. Using an &quot;Early Victories&quot; strategy, we seek to incentivize these models&apos; replication nationwide with Government&apos;s financing.</narrative>
  </description>
